From bdb5c9cc3408c96114ac42717b27d42ea245e8da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Naster17 <naster17.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:21:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] vulkan : fused mHC route/merge kernels

One workgroup per (token,stream) folds the streams, projects router logits, runs Sinkhorn and writes packed gates in a single dispatch; merge is elementwise. Replaces ~100 tiny ops per router.

Assisted-by: Qwen3.8-Max
